tle\">\n   306→                        <a href=\"https://superset.sh\" target=\"_blank\">Superset</a>\n   307→                    </div>\n   308→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   309→                        An agent-native IDE that orchestrates multiple AI coding agents in parallel, using git worktree isolation to prevent conflicts. Core is multi-agent orchestration engine with code editing as supporting feature.\n   310→                    </div>\n   311→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   312→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n   313→                        <span class=\"tag\">YC P26</span>\n   314→                        <span class=\"release-date\">Released: 2026-05-23</span>\n   315→                    </div>\n   316→                    <div class=\"quote-item\">\"Not an agent, but an OS for running agents\"</div>\n   317→                    <div class=\"item-url\"><a href=\"https://superset.sh\" target=\"_blank\">superset.sh</a></div>\n   318→                </div>\n   319→\n   320→                <div class=\"item\">\n   321→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   322→                        <a href=\"https://antigravity.google\" target=\"_blank\">Google Antigravity CLI</a>\n   323→                    </div>\n   324→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   325→                        A terminal-based coding agent CLI that allows developers to run and monitor AI coding agents directly from their command line. Features multi-step reasoning, multi-file editing, tool calling, and persistent history.\n   326→                    </div>\n   327→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   328→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   329→                        <span class=\"tag\">#2 Product Hunt</span>\n   330→                        <span class=\"release-date\">Released: 2026-05-23</span>\n   331→                    </div>\n   332→               